&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and implement appropriate individualized care plans, including manual therapeutic exercises, gait training, balance, and other interventions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
