&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt; is seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Speech Language Pathologist, SLP, &lt;/strong&gt;for a per diem / part time opportunity to complete &lt;strong&gt;home health&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;visits &lt;/strong&gt;with adult and geriatric patients on a per visit basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
