&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is currently seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Therapist Assistant, PTA, &lt;/strong&gt;for a &lt;strong&gt;per diem&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;opportunity performing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;home health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;visits.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;This office services adult and geriatric patients on a per visit basis in territories throughout &lt;strong&gt;Oakton, VA and surrounding areas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
