&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you interested in a rewarding career helping children with autism reach their fullest potential? Join BAYADA and make a meaningful impact everyday!!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Are you passionate about helping children with autism thrive and reach their full potential? At BAYADA Home Health Care, we believe that our clients come first—&lt;em&gt;and our employees are our greatest asset.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re a dedicated Registered Behavior Technician (RBT) looking to make a difference, we want to meet you!&lt;br&gt;We’re currently hiring RBTs to provide 1:1 Applied Behavior Analysis (ABA) therapy to children and young adults diagnosed with Autism Spectrum Disorder. Services are delivered in-home, in the community, and at our Pennsauken Center for ABA Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flexible Scheduling:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Part time positions available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shifts available Monday-Friday between 8a-6:30p&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Offers Registered Behavior Technicians (RBTs):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BCBA Oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career Advancement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Appreciation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based of experience and education&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for Registered Behavior Technician (RBT):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid RBT Certificate from the Behavior Analyst Certification Board (BACB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1yr of experience working with children with developmental/ intellectual disabilities preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPR/FA Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/tRyR2Dzui8E&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities for Registered Behavior Technician (RBT):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with clients and follow the established treatment plan/behavior support plan for implementing skill acquisition and behavior reduction procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain effective, supportive, and therapeutic relationships with clients &amp;amp; families. Respect the values, thoughts, beliefs, and attitudes of clients and families.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement behavior therapy techniques as instructed by the Behavioral Services Manager and Behavior Specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document interventions and progress towards goals accurately and in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect behavior data as specified in client behavior support plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review data and progress reports with Behavioral Services Manager and Behavior Specialist in order to strategize program improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As applicable to the treatment plan, provide habilitation, training, instruction, and assistance to help the client acquire and maintain skills and to help meet identified goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As applicable, provide transportation related to the implementation of activities as directed by the treatment plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and/or support to the client in interpersonal skills, the development and maintenance of personal relationships, and in living in his/her community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor health status and physical condition and reports any changes in the client’s condition or other incidents to the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits You’ll Love:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Possibility of Health Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Medical, dental, vision, prescription coverage, FSA and HSA options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Scholarship and development opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognition &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Recognition programs, referral bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positive Work Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stable and supportive work environment with around the clock clinical support and a team environment that cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;PTO (paid time off) and paid holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;401(k) with company match, employer-paid life insurance, employee assistance program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thrive in a Culture That Cares:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put your well-being first, fostering an inclusive and collaborative environment of belonging where you can achieve your goals. Don&#39;t just take our word for it:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rated 3.8 stars on Indeed &amp;amp; Glassdoor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Greatest Workplace for Overall, Women, Parents &amp;amp; Families, Diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forbes Best Employers for Veterans, Women&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA recognizes and rewards our RBTs who set and maintain the highest standards of excellence. Join our caring team today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
