&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Love nursing but ready for a slower, more meaningful pace?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;BAYADA is hiring compassionate LPNs to support pediatric clients in the home in Huntington and nearby towns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You’ll enjoy flexible shifts, weekly pay, and the ability to bring comfort and stability to the people who need it most in your community. Fast-track hiring incentives available for nurses who are ready to complete onboarding quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
