&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;We have a Full Time&lt;strong&gt; Registered Nurse &lt;/strong&gt;opportunity open now in the New Castle County area&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
