&lt;p&gt;Ability to build exceptional, collaborative relationships within all levels of the organization inside and outside of L&amp;amp;D; show up as a positive culture carrier aligned with our SoFi values, driving inclusiveness and mentorship&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong organizational skills; history of balancing competing priorities with the ability to adapt to the changing needs of the business while meeting deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
