&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A stipend for catered lunch on Tuesdays and Thursdays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
