&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the position:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As aPre-Sales Engineer, you’ll play a pivotal role in positioning AvePoint solutions for our customers, by designing and delivering tailored solutions that address complex business challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leveraging your deep business and technical&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;and strong consultative skills, you will work&amp;nbsp;closely with customers, the virtual account teams (VAT), and product specialists to understand requirements, design solutions, and&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;the value of AvePoint’s offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As the technical lead for opportunities and key customers,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;define and drive the technical win strategy from start to finish; proactively uncovering customer challenges, shaping solution approaches, and moving the deal forward from a technical standpoint. You will be involved from discovery calls, to delivering compelling technical presentations and demos, to taking charge of proof-of-concept initiatives and&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;expert guidance throughout both pre-sales and post-sales phases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;with a high-level of independence&amp;nbsp;and autonomy, while collaborating closely with sales teams and senior technical leaders to ensure customers achieve outstanding results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who brings:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
